[{"title":"章宗挽词","author":"赵秉文","text":"凤纪三千岁，龙飞二十年。\n竟辞徽号册，空颂柏梁篇。\n授圣金縢起，遗言玉几宣。\n建平何苦谶，雨泣戴仁天。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":502,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"暮春","author":"赵秉文","text":"自嗟中岁在，不与暮春宜。\n非复欢娱地，其如老大时。\n百年归览镜，万事入支颐。\n此意无人会，陶情一赋诗。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":503,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"汝瓷酒尊","author":"赵秉文","text":"秘色创尊形，中泓贮醁醽。\n缩肩潜蝘蜓，蟠腹涨青宁。\n巧琢晴岚古，圆瑳碧玉荧。\n银杯犹羽化，风雨慎缄扃。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":504,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"涌云楼雨","author":"赵秉文","text":"满地江湖梦，连阴晦朔秋。\n雨中山似醉，风外浪如愁。\n眼病憎黄卷，心安任白头。\n明年一官满，谁复话登楼。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":505,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"穷愁二首 其一","author":"赵秉文","text":"乍喜三庚伏，还惊一叶凉。\n穷愁天色少，睡思雨声长。\n掩卷悲兴替，怀人问在亡。\n平生庾开府，诗兴未能忘。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":506,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"穷愁二首 其二","author":"赵秉文","text":"何处新秋好，飘萧意欲仙。\n乍凉新雨后，欲曙未明前。\n莎影蛩吟地，松梢鹤唳天。\n物情无好丑，适意各天然。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":507,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"和潘师韵","author":"赵秉文","text":"暌离三十载，重此叩玄微。\n日月双蓬鬓，乾坤一布衣。\n月明涡水宿，秋老华峰归。\n不得陪仙驭，浮生有是非。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":508,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"和政老九日韵","author":"赵秉文","text":"数日闲斋卧，体中殊不佳。\n那知是重九，但喜见黄花。\n矫首怀天末，携壶傍水涯。\n琳宫题壁处，醉墨字欹斜。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":509,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"赠茅先生","author":"赵秉文","text":"二室神仙宅，三茅道士家。\n野人遗竹帚，弟子扫松花。\n有道能擒虎，无心任践蛇。\n天平有陈迹，吾欲老烟霞。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":510,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"大雪二首 其一","author":"赵秉文","text":"大雪无朝暮，衰年见未曾。\n园林春浩荡，川岳气凭陵。\n云惨天应漏，阳微井欲冰。\n欲寻安道舍，何处一龛灯。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":511,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"大雪二首 其二","author":"赵秉文","text":"大雪欲平檐，黄昏气转严。\n天边迷草树，云外失乌蟾。\n天意平高下，人情有爱嫌。\n抱贪酬桂玉，楼上醉厌厌。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":512,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"雪霁","author":"赵秉文","text":"黄云霁雪威，寒日淡晖晖。\n雨砌晴先滴，风檐落更飞。\n侵淩池面瘦，拥肿树身肥。\n长忆庐陵老，忧时咏铁衣。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":513,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"十月菊得深字","author":"赵秉文","text":"地偏开较晚，风劲可能禁。\n雨渍金英浅，寒添紫晕深。\n抱丛无晚蝶，窥蕊有贞禽。\n留待飘云后，梅花约重寻。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":514,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"白雁","author":"赵秉文","text":"波静影逾白，霜清鸣更哀。\n乾坤双鬓老，风雪一声来。\n林迥隐犹见，天长去复回。\n物情嫌太洁，莫使羽毛摧。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":515,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"雪","author":"赵秉文","text":"朔云连郑圃，飞雪满梁园。\n猛势池心灭，清声竹外繁。\n饥鸦寒啄树，败屦踵临门。\n何以娱佳客，开轩对一尊。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":516,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"野菊","author":"赵秉文","text":"离离嵓下菊，无主混蓬茅。\n路断秋光隔，山明水影交。\n荒丛鸣蟋蟀，寒叶挂蟏蛸。\n拟访陶庐饮，柴扉何处敲。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":517,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"岳观","author":"赵秉文","text":"步屧方坛上，行吟避草芽。\n帘声风拂燕，池影柳蹲鸦。\n天入濛濛雨，春归淡淡花。\n游春心未老，墙外度香车。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":518,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"秋雨","author":"赵秉文","text":"天边认遥电，云际尚残阳。\n雨脚夜深白，涛头晓霁黄。\n沙边明雁影，林下见山光。\n拟尽登高兴，秋怀祇自伤。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":519,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"手掐桦皮弹琴图","author":"赵秉文","text":"何人聊幻巧，袖里出毫端。\n道眼无二见，齐心废六官。\n烦君无耳听，寓我非指弹。\n攦却伯牙手，秋风万籁寒。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":520,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"早出新安","author":"赵秉文","text":"夜宿新安驿，平明雪塞溪。\n马头迷旧路，虎迹印新泥。\n冰冻寒流狭，天衔远路低。\n人稀山店远，茅屋只闻鸡。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":521,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"明惠皇后挽歌词四十首 其一","author":"赵秉文","text":"皇明齐月象，厚德配坤元。\n恻怛忧民意，勤劳毓圣恩。\n国风悲卷耳，星纬暗轩辕。\n丧妣人心痛，哀号望寝园。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":522,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"明惠皇后挽歌词四十首 其二","author":"赵秉文","text":"威仪文物备，祖载出菆涂。\n薄葬追三代，严禋致九虞。\n仁恩遗凤诏，功德载龟趺。\n左右重兴业，诗书赞永图。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":523,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"明惠皇后挽歌词四十首 其三","author":"赵秉文","text":"太极齐元始，三光并照临。\n勤劳忧国念，恻怛爱民心。\n玄鸟歌殷母，思齐咏太任。\n两朝难俪美，万古播徽音。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":524,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"明惠皇后挽歌词四十首 其四","author":"赵秉文","text":"阶蓂凋叶尽，宫漏滴声残。\n玉几俄遗训，龙楼罢问安。\n云容愁惨戚，风色恸悲酸。\n万古馀功德，煌煌玉册寒。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":525,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"明惠皇后挽歌词四十首 其五","author":"赵秉文","text":"畴昔占虫梦，今来叹凤飞。\n汉宫遗内则，文母谢芳徽。\n永卧重泉夜，空馀大练衣。\n魏郊宁久驻，会看德陵归。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":526,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"明惠皇后挽歌词四十首 其六","author":"赵秉文","text":"阿母瑶池去，应归海上峰。\n宝奁空有象，练幄静无踪。\n孝享严三庙，舆仪备九龙。\n献陵今密迩，挥泪洒楸松。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":527,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"明惠皇后挽歌词四十首 其七","author":"赵秉文","text":"圣德高千古，慈闱十万春。\n地维伤绝纪，月彩忽韬轮。\n应物归先识，忧民感至仁。\n神仪虽已閟，遗范不埃尘。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":528,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"明惠皇后挽歌词四十首 其八","author":"赵秉文","text":"膺符称太母，衍庆广金源。\n衣练蠲重彩，躬蚕屈至尊。\n赐冰防病暍，恤狱恐民冤。\n孝意遵遗训，词臣叹永言。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":529,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"明惠皇后挽歌词四十首 其九","author":"赵秉文","text":"葛覃歌节用，卷耳颂求贤。\n遽厌人间世，还为物外仙。\n会观歌薤露，无复梦扪天。\n玉座虚长乐，依然夜月悬。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":530,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"明惠皇后挽歌词四十首 其十","author":"赵秉文","text":"谦抑传家法，宽仁沃帝聪。\n礼崇光教塔，时奉孝严宫。\n皂隶恩皆及，嫔妃爱悉同。\n绕阶花泣露，应是怨西风。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":531,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"明惠皇后挽歌词四十首 其十一","author":"赵秉文","text":"庆源钟马邓，何止活千人。\n阴化行中壸，私权抑外亲。\n凤舆归厚夜，蚕馆闭长春。\n萧寺诸嫔御，能忘赐膳频。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":532,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"明惠皇后挽歌词四十首 其十二","author":"赵秉文","text":"方享东朝奉，俄成甲子还。\n玉梳音窅窅，彤管事班班。\n陵寝音容閟，蓬莱日月閒。\n丁忧遗诏在，恩泽满人间。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":533,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"明惠皇后挽歌词四十首 其十三","author":"赵秉文","text":"式属多难际，方承长乐欢。\n霜飞金殿冷，月没桂宫寒。\n雨泣愁云惨，风悲薤露残。\n南山为乐石，遗美岂能刊。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":534,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"明惠皇后挽歌词四十首 其十四","author":"赵秉文","text":"一纪坤仪正，千龄母范彰。\n徽音齐太姒，厚德配娥皇。\n衣练昭纯俭，因山戒厚藏。\n伤心彤史上，千古播遗芳。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":535,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"明惠皇后挽歌词四十首 其十五","author":"赵秉文","text":"缑氏传仙裔，燕山启梦符。\n化人先正己，祈福为民敷。\n疾殆申遗命，忧深示永图。\n伤心虞帝事，烟雨暗苍梧。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":536,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"明惠皇后挽歌词四十首 其十六","author":"赵秉文","text":"奔走来群辟，哀摧动百灵。\n妖氛湮壁月，霄汉殒轩星。\n玉几贻周训，妆奁泣汉庭。\n近畿遵薄葬，神意想来宁。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":537,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"明惠皇后挽歌词四十首 其十七","author":"赵秉文","text":"身尊恒率礼，名正更持谦。\n椒掖坤仪正，天庭母训严。\n鸿名登玉简，遗像入霜缣。\n异日朝陵处，应须启镜奁。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":538,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"明惠皇后挽歌词四十首 其十八","author":"赵秉文","text":"宽和能待物，凝密劝行仁。\n道德持三宝，恩私逮四民。\n两朝隆汉礼，十乱冠周臣。\n一旦仙游去，空馀四海春。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":539,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"明惠皇后挽歌词四十首 其十九","author":"赵秉文","text":"心知为善乐，敬傅又尊师。\n国化濯衣俭，民歌赐药慈。\n诵经虚玉案，奉佛冷金彝。\n遗旨无穷恨，风吹遍九疑。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":540,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"明惠皇后挽歌词四十首 其二十","author":"赵秉文","text":"六綍辞秋殿，玄堂启夜扉。\n一朝藏寿器，千载閟容衣。\n县象轩星掩，哀歌薤露稀。\n松楸交隧道，会有五云飞。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":541,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"明惠皇后挽歌词四十首 其二十一","author":"赵秉文","text":"保阿成训在，阃阈令仪昭。\n俭德高千古，仁声溢两朝。\n事随流水逝，愁逐冷云飘。\n仙驭知何适，凭谁问泬寥。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":542,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"明惠皇后挽歌词四十首 其二十二","author":"赵秉文","text":"阴化毗乾造，熙朝赖母临。\n功勋新女史，德泽浃人心。\n偃月丰容閟，轩星瑞彩沉。\n笳声哀不尽，陵柏自森森。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":543,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"明惠皇后挽歌词四十首 其二十三","author":"赵秉文","text":"元勋施社稷，茂德庇人民。\n色养嗟中阻，灵游忽上宾。\n侍臣歌薤露，神物护龙輴。\n祔庙推尊谥，千龄宝册新。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":544,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"明惠皇后挽歌词四十首 其二十四","author":"赵秉文","text":"太姒敦周化，涂山启夏家。\n尊名天比峻，淑德日增华。\n孝享心何切，仙游望愈赊。\n空馀遗令在，攀慕极幽遐。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":545,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"明惠皇后挽歌词四十首 其二十五","author":"赵秉文","text":"天祸缠兴庆，幽堂掩后帏。\n徽音知有嗣，孝养痛长违。\n夜月空椒屋，秋风冷玉衣。\n遥瞻陵寝上，惨淡暮云飞。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":546,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"明惠皇后挽歌词四十首 其二十六","author":"赵秉文","text":"风急摇寒树，虹蜚薄太阴。\n云随仙驭远，尘入绮帘深。\n索莫长秋外，萧条湘水浔。\n圣情时怅望，流泪满宸襟。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":547,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"明惠皇后挽歌词四十首 其二十七","author":"赵秉文","text":"吉梦扪天后，明禋配地时。\n嫔虞彰淑慎，生武极恩慈。\n无复金舆返，空瞻画翣驰。\n萧萧松柏路，长夜閟神仪。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":548,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"明惠皇后挽歌词四十首 其二十八","author":"赵秉文","text":"玉音昭懿行，彤管列闳休。\n今日归陵寝，何年返玉楼。\n圣心方尽孝，鸾驭竟难留。\n陵树西风里，千秋万古愁。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":549,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"明惠皇后挽歌词四十首 其二十九","author":"赵秉文","text":"群生资茂育，至德果难名。\n凭几言犹在，因山事已成。\n西风翻画翣，落日送铭旌。\n羽卫归来晚，萧萧万马鸣。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":550,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"明惠皇后挽歌词四十首 其三十","author":"赵秉文","text":"音容归寿器，管御玉衣闲。\n圣孝空如慕，慈颜痛莫攀。\n云愁萦汴水，雾惨锁夷山。\n怅望白杨路，翟车竟不还。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":551,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"明惠皇后挽歌词四十首 其三十一","author":"赵秉文","text":"孙谋贻嗣圣，内教辅先朝。\n孝敬全终始，勤劳继夙宵。\n民灾忧水沴，边患虑天骄。\n大渐惟几际，犹思俭德昭。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":552,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"明惠皇后挽歌词四十首 其三十二","author":"赵秉文","text":"一纪成功著，乘鸾上九天。\n物生思德载，圣虑想恩怜。\n俭素言犹在，宽慈事有传。\n禁闱斜日晚，空袅宝炉烟。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":553,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"明惠皇后挽歌词四十首 其三十三","author":"赵秉文","text":"飘飖成远驾，寂静掩玄堂。\n荡荡神功著，巍巍圣业彰。\n周任扬溢美，汉邓蔼馀芳。\n末命丁宁意，忧民不暂忘。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":554,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"明惠皇后挽歌词四十首 其三十四","author":"赵秉文","text":"褒赞存公议，无惭六后名。\n妆奁空有迹，佩玉寂无声。\n祭享升清庙，哀号动圣情。\n神灵阴有力，保佑再升平。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":555,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"明惠皇后挽歌词四十首 其三十五","author":"赵秉文","text":"蘋藻亲三奠，袆褕备六衣。\n坤元方载物，轩宿遽沦晖。\n庙貌严新祔，神游邈不归。\n白云无处所，长傍德陵飞。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":556,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"明惠皇后挽歌词四十首 其三十六","author":"赵秉文","text":"冯相方观祲，巫阳忽告灾。\n千秋临宝殿，一夕閟泉台。\n纚绋悲长往，灵輴挽不回。\n昊天思罔极，长使圣情哀。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":557,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"明惠皇后挽歌词四十首 其三十七","author":"赵秉文","text":"仙源周太子，华裔汉徵君。\n生圣休祥著，忧民俭德勤。\n姜嫄忻懿范，光烈恧鸿勋。\n辅就中兴业，飘然返白云。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":558,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"明惠皇后挽歌词四十首 其三十八","author":"赵秉文","text":"蜃辂陈彝宪，龟人献吉占。\n郊衢笳鼓咽，羽卫禁兵严。\n云气迎鸾驭，秋尘翳宝奁。\n祝官扬至德，简册发幽潜。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":559,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"明惠皇后挽歌词四十首 其三十九","author":"赵秉文","text":"月殿封鸾鉴，风帏卧佩环。\n百神来肃卫，万骑尽虚还。\n雨泣铭旌湿，风凄穗幄闲。\n仙游无觅处，追慕惨宸颜。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":560,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"明惠皇后挽歌词四十首 其四十","author":"赵秉文","text":"月晕惊亏薄，川流骇沸腾。\n忧勤终爽豫，报施似无凭。\n长夜扃银海，愁云惨玉绳。\n圣心哀念切，素幄每晨兴。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":561,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"河上二首 其一","author":"赵秉文","text":"筑堰分泉脉，开沟断荻芽。\n风期占月晕，水信谶桃花。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":562,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"河上二首 其二","author":"赵秉文","text":"旱爱濒河麦，晴怜唤雨鸠。\n春随挑菜侣，月趁捕鱼舟。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":563,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"雪中登真定阁","author":"赵秉文","text":"风月不如意，寺楼高处吟。\n城中十万户，一雪太平心。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":564,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"连云潮退","author":"赵秉文","text":"夕阳明岛寺，海气入边城。\n潮落青鱼出，泥深白鸟行。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":565,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"郎山杂咏十首 其一 天城","author":"赵秉文","text":"造化抟清气，秀出天城山。\n青松伴僧老，白云如我闲。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":566,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"郎山杂咏十首 其二 马耳峰","author":"赵秉文","text":"房驷落人间，入石露双碧。\n月明闻夜嘶，惊落山头石。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":567,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"郎山杂咏十首 其三 仙人峰","author":"赵秉文","text":"世界几微尘，古今一昏晓。\n笑谢区中缘，独立万物表。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":568,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"郎山杂咏十首 其四 摩云峰","author":"赵秉文","text":"青山本无情，白云自来往。\n身在浮云中，仰看浮云上。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":569,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"郎山杂咏十首 其五 独冠峰","author":"赵秉文","text":"大埚难为兄，小埚难为弟。\n百里见主峰，众山皆迤逦。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":570,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"郎山杂咏十首 其六 五芝峰","author":"赵秉文","text":"白云如幽人，出山本无期。\n朝来抱幽石，五峰成五芝。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":571,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"郎山杂咏十首 其七 郁秀峰","author":"赵秉文","text":"道人西涧来，衣上南山雨。\n心知石堂烟，晴峰正堪数。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":572,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}}]